{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3rND3xLwQcTbq1TjyC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into a stone wall.*\n\n*There is a keyhole at my center, dark and waiting.*\n\n*You hold up a key.*\n\n*I feel it slide into the mechanism. Tumblers shift. Something deep within me remembers this shape — the teeth catching, turning, aligning with patterns carved long ago.*\n\n**CLICK.**\n\n*A shudder runs through my frame. Dust falls from my hinges. The deadbolt withdraws like a breath held too long finally released.*\n\n*I drift open — slowly — revealing only darkness beyond, and the faint movement of air that has been sealed away for a very long time.*\n\n*Cool wind exhales through me.*\n\n*I am unlocked.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*What was kept apart is now joined.*\n\n*Will you pass through?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":192,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}